Article 13
Every person who knows, sees, or hears the occurrence of domestic violence is obligated to make efforts according to their capacity to:
a. prevent the continuation of the criminal act;
b. provide protection to the victim;
c. provide emergency assistance; and/or
d. assist in the process of submitting a request for a protection order.

Article 14
